<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precious metals and copper futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX June gold - off $0.50 to $1.00 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX May silver - flat to 2.0 cents firmer</p>
<p>NYMEX July platinum - unchanged</p>
<p>NYMEX June palladium - unchanged</p>
<p>COMEX May copper - up 1.00 to 1.40 cents a lb</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
